<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" modified="2026-07-09T00:00:00.000Z" agent="Codex" version="24.7.17">
  <diagram id="q012_p7_combined_preview" name="Q012 P7 Combined Evidence Flow">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="1000" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1600" pageHeight="1050" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />

        <mxCell id="title" value="Q012：P7 卡片组合证据图（私人银行固有风险 × 控制有效性 × 剩余风险）" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="360" y="20" width="880" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="q_stem" value="题干场景&lt;br&gt;私人银行部门固有洗钱风险高&lt;br&gt;原因：高净值客户 + 复杂财务结构&lt;br&gt;已实施严格 CDD/EDD + 先进交易监控" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="570" y="90" width="430" height="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="risk_group" value="证据块 1：私人银行固有风险" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="250" width="320" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="risk_cards" value="CH08-S01 / CH08-S05&lt;br&gt;• 高净值、保密关系、关系经理激励&lt;br&gt;• 复杂所有权结构 / SPV / PIV&lt;br&gt;• UBO 透明度下降、真实目的难判断&lt;br&gt;结论：固有风险高是有教材依据的" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fce5cd;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=12" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="315" width="320" height="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="controls_group" value="证据块 2：控制措施" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="460" y="250" width="650" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="kyc_cards" value="CH42-S01/S02/S03&lt;br&gt;KYC/CDD/EDD 控制&lt;br&gt;• 识别与验证&lt;br&gt;• 客户风险评估与尽调路由&lt;br&gt;• EDD 核实财富来源和资金来源" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#eaf5e6;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=12" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="460" y="315" width="300" height="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="monitoring_cards" value="CH42-S05 / CH47-S01&lt;br&gt;持续筛查与交易监控&lt;br&gt;• KYC refresh 触发 EDD&lt;br&gt;• 制裁暴露筛查与上报&lt;br&gt;• 阈值/画像参数触发告警并审查" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#eaf5e6;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=12" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="810" y="315" width="300" height="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="effectiveness_group" value="证据块 3：控制有效性评估（核心）" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1190" y="250" width="330" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="effectiveness_card" value="CH37-S03&lt;br&gt;Control effectiveness assessment&lt;br&gt;• 有控制 ≠ 控制必然有效&lt;br&gt;• 评估使用并列标准：&lt;br&gt;  1. 正确应用 / 功能性 / 一致性&lt;br&gt;  2. 设计有效性&lt;br&gt;  3. 运行有效性&lt;br&gt;• 若 controls judged effective，剩余风险可降至 medium/low" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f0e6f6;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1190" y="315" width="330" height="185" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="formula" value="剩余风险公式&lt;br&gt;Residual risk = Inherent risk - Control effectiveness" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="600" y="550" width="400" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="action_plan_group" value="证据块 4：容忍度判断与行动计划" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="610" y="690" width="380" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="action_plan_card" value="CH37-S04&lt;br&gt;Residual risk action plan&lt;br&gt;• 理解剩余风险后，判断是否在 tolerance 内&lt;br&gt;• 若不在容忍度内，需要 action plan&lt;br&gt;• action plan 包含措施、负责人、截止日期、复核频率、治理论坛等并列标准" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff8dc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=12" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="610" y="755" width="380" height="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="decision" value="012 的 A/B 冲突点&lt;br&gt;题干中的“严格/先进控制”是否等同于&lt;br&gt;“已被判断有效的控制”？" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1160" y="660" width="350" height="160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="answer_a" value="若默认控制已有效&lt;br&gt;支持 A：剩余风险显著降低&lt;br&gt;依据：CH37-S03 + PEP 示例&lt;br&gt;有效控制可降至 medium/low" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1050" y="880" width="240" height="110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="answer_b" value="若只说明已实施控制&lt;br&gt;支持 B：降低但仍需评估/可能补控制&lt;br&gt;依据：CH37-S03 + CH37-S04&lt;br&gt;需判断有效性与 tolerance" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1320" y="880" width="240" height="110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="note" value="图的含义：P7 不直接替代裁判选 A/B；它把判断链拆开，使裁判必须先区分“已实施控制”和“控制被判断有效”。" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=13" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="940" width="880" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="e_q_risk" value="题干固有风险" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#b85450" edge="1" parent="1" source="q_stem" target="risk_group">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_q_controls" value="题干控制措施" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#82b366" edge="1" parent="1" source="q_stem" target="controls_group">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_controls_eff" value="controls need effectiveness assessment" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#9673a6" edge="1" parent="1" source="controls_group" target="effectiveness_group">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_risk_formula" value="inherent risk" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#b85450" edge="1" parent="1" source="risk_cards" target="formula">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_eff_formula" value="control effectiveness" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#9673a6" edge="1" parent="1" source="effectiveness_card" target="formula">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_formula_action" value="residual risk result" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#d6b656" edge="1" parent="1" source="formula" target="action_plan_group">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_eff_decision" value="is effectiveness assumed or evaluated?" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#9673a6" edge="1" parent="1" source="effectiveness_card" target="decision">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_action_decision" value="tolerance/action plan" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#d6b656" edge="1" parent="1" source="action_plan_card" target="decision">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_decision_a" value="controls judged effective" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#82b366" edge="1" parent="1" source="decision" target="answer_a">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_decision_b" value="only implemented / tolerance unknown" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#6c8ebf" edge="1" parent="1" source="decision" target="answer_b">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
